      "writtenOn": "2024-04-02T03:51:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What would it take to include the RAM protection feature in Zephyr? Generally, we\u0027d like feature parity between ECOS and Zephyr. Specifically, we\u0027ll need this feature for helipilot on Zephyr. We could add a TODO:b/## here to add in Zephyr support since this is outside the scope of this CL, could you file a bug for RAM protect support on Zephyr?",
